       cylinder placeholder's own convention (robot-side Z-extent = 16.1mm,
       exactly its documented plate thickness -- a real signal this is
       right; tool-side is weaker evidence, its shortest dimension (28.4mm)
       is Y, not Z, meaning it is NOT a simple flat plate along Z the way
       robot-side is). If the real mounting orientation is confirmed wrong,
       fix here, not by returning to the cylinder pair. -->
  <asset>
    <mesh name="toolchanger_robot_side_mesh" file="meshes/toolchanger_robot_side.stl"/>
