           bought wrist/floor clearance by translating the WHOLE assembly,
           flange joint included. Both of its premises expired the next day:
             1. It sized everything for a 0.30m rod. The rod is 0.12m
                (measured, 2026-08-11) -- the floor constraint that ruled out
