           MEASURED at this value, mj_geomDistance + forward kinematics over
           the FULL +-180deg hinge sweep, at BOTH arm poses in use at the
           time (pendulum_balance_torque_lqr.py's [0,-pi/2,pi/2,-pi/2,-pi/2,0]
           and pendulum_swingup_energy_shaping.py's hanging pose): min distance
