           Still a PLACEHOLDER in one respect, unchanged by this fix: the
           flange->pivot standoff is not CAD-verified (only 2 of the ~15
           custom parts have STEP files this environment can read). What IS
           now CAD-grounded is that the two tool-changer plates stack flush
